iler":false,"text":"意外と小心者で情にもろい所もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セックス中は猫タイプ"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13202","sourceWorkId":"24527","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"高飛車で命令口調な姉。 男顔負けの汚い言葉も平気で口にする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"派手な見た目だが優しいところもあり、弟のことは可愛がっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意外と小心者で、情にもろい一面もある"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスの男子全員が穴兄弟で、3Pも経験済み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セックス中はネコタイプ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49584"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb1a61798f92bca0ffcee58bcb202694041086cfb448c1eea1bc042c7c3274ec.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c21bc1c48f17de3daa7c9f89a3decdfd7a2e96e1e04d3f0961cb74e24d0c9b8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"薫子","creatorId":"vndb:s10539","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10539","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10539","name":"薫子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71833","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c54918","characterName":"陽向 蘭","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49585","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"203831"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13201"],"vndbCharacterId":"c54918"},"originalCharacterName":"陽向 蘭","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"調子がいい末っ子タイプ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉には頭が上がらないが、主人公へは自分より年下扱いする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学習能力が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも笑顔で愛嬌があるが意外と勝ち気でプライドが高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"狙った男性（イケメン　高学歴　スタイル　センスともに良い）を落とせないと感じた場合、手のひらを返した様に冷たい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セックスは快楽を求めるスポーツのようなものと認識し相手は不特定多数存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本命がいてもセフレは2～3人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚系ビッチは「下ネタをベラベラ喋る」ということは絶対にしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、勉強熱心で、下ネタを知らないということは決してない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性が発した下ネタに対して、完全に知らないフリを貫くこともなく、かといって否定もしない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13201","sourceWorkId":"24527","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"調子がいい末っ子タイプの妹。 姉には頭が上がらないが、兄へは年下扱いする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学習能力が高く愛嬌もあるが、意外と勝ち気でプライドが高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高学歴イケメンを狙うも、落とせないと判断すればすぐに手のひらを返す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セックスは快楽が伴う運動と認識しており、セフレを2～3人はキープしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"……そういう女性になりたいという願望がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚系ビッチなので下ネタを好んで口にするようなことはない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49585"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a1effde00557dffc6a25c4ca26614409899da3f71b9f00da8fa41c890d8e6b62.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/974bf922652f7292fe8b8f59d0d830168d6a2c4b8cc4d2570d45433df5f870ff.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"月下 夏樹","creatorId":"vndb:s10758","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10758","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10758","name":"月下 夏樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71834","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c54919","characterName":"陽向 楓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49586","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"203831"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13203"],"vndbCharacterId":"c54919"},"originalCharacterName":"陽向 楓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"中の上程度のイケメン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気が弱くて何事にも消極的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子に挟まれているせいかちょっと中性的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に優しい。勝ち気な姉妹に挟まれて育った為、女性の前では内気で弱々しさを装っているが責任感が強く雄々しい面を内に秘めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の回転が速く人の気持ちを推察する能力は長けている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13203","sourceWorkId":"24527","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"中の上程度のイケメン。 気が弱くて何事にも消極的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝ち気な姉妹に挟まれて育ったため、女性の前では内気な態度をとってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しい性格で責任感が強く、実は雄々しい面を内に秘めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の回転も速く、人の気持ちを推察する能力に長けている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49586"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb45ca7da8c6ee10754e29acbc8a113fa9a8cbb9c6dacfbaa0ca388c892edc75.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/5372b7e9357e05f0381129d60ef7f872891b702c38ac7ad12e9452324d1ed208.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:450","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:450","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:450","name":"コンプリーツ","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:24527:450","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p176","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p176","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p176","name":"N43 Project","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:163906:v20373","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p181","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p181","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p181","name":"コンプリーツ","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:163907:v20373","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p181","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p181","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p181","name":"コンプリーツ","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:56180:v20373","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p181","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p181","canonicalEntityId":"vndb